  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lupane Women Craft and Farm Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to increase product supplies to the market consistently and on time through increased production and membership participation. The membership will receive business training, technical training to improve on the business acumen and diversity or quality of products. Internal control systems will also be improved.</narrative>
  </description>
